  surf2grid time = 0.691328 secs
  map/comm1/comm2/comm3/comm4/split percent = 38.0864 0.0217721 29.1776 2.4271 7.63865 12.273
surf_collide	    1 diffuse 300.0 1.0
surf_modify         all collide 1

create_particles    air n 0
